{"4618550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goblin museum", "steam_appid": 4618550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4792400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Goblin Museum</strong>, where cultural preservation means stealing shiny things and calling it “curation.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your fellow goblins run the finest museum no one asked for. To fill your halls, you’ll head out on totally-not-legal expeditions to scan, dig, and pull valuables out of the ground with your gravity gun while everything goes wrong at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police show up. Thieving animals show up. Your friends panic. The helicopter is leaving. And somehow your team still has to pile onto the giant pickup magnet before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the chaos, haul home the loot, expand your museum, and prove once and for all that goblins are misunderstood scholars of “found objects.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic online co-op extraction runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, dig, loot, throw, and scream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape cops and fend off loot-snatching thieves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team extraction where everyone needs to make it out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your museum between expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble glorious collections from questionably acquired artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear to find better loot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/0a5f97bf8067fd5fcd7a8bf9f8cb3a06.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/0a5f97bf8067fd5fcd7a8bf9f8cb3a06.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/0a5f97bf8067fd5fcd7a8bf9f8cb3a06.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/911929aa07a8bc949946f7035fb0b48b.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Goblin Museum</strong>, where cultural preservation means stealing shiny things and calling it “curation.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your fellow goblins run the finest museum no one asked for. To fill your halls, you’ll head out on totally-not-legal expeditions to scan, dig, and pull valuables out of the ground with your gravity gun while everything goes wrong at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/43432c103deb92f61a719e58828977ff.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police show up. Thieving animals show up. Your friends panic. The helicopter is leaving. And somehow your team still has to pile onto the giant pickup magnet before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the chaos, haul home the loot, expand your museum, and prove once and for all that goblins are misunderstood scholars of “found objects.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.poster.avif?t=1785437803\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.webm?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4618550/extras/35a3b56e1c8061fb3ab89b7c6b282e33.mp4?t=1785437803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic online co-op extraction runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, dig, loot, throw, and scream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape cops and fend off loot-snatching thieves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team extraction where everyone needs to make it out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your museum between expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble glorious collections from questionably acquired artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear to find better loot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat